<title>HUNGARY: Zalakeramia '96 IAS after-tax 968.7 mln.</title>
<headline>Zalakeramia '96 IAS after-tax 968.7 mln.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year 1996, ending December 31.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of forints unless stated)</p>
<p>					 Jan-Dec 96     Jan-Dec 95</p>
<p>    Operating profit		 1,035.1   vs    772.5</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		   1,048.9   vs    812.4</p>
<p>    After-tax profit		   968.7   vs    731.9</p>
<p>    Net sales			  3,829.1   vs  3,256.4</p>
<p>    Costs of sales		   2,553.0   vs  1,772.9</p>
<p>    Gross margin		     1,276.2   vs  1,483.5</p>
<p>Selling, general and</p>
<p>     administrative costs	    537.4   vs    859.9</p>
<p>    Other operating revenue	  563.2   vs    416.6</p>
<p>    Other operating expense	  266.9   vs    267.7</p>
<p>    Interest revenue		    71.3   vs     80.8</p>
<p>    Interest expenditure		57.4   vs     41.0</p>
<p>    Taxation				80.2   vs     80.5</p>
<p>NOTE - Zalakeramia Rt is a tile manufacturer.</p>
<p>The figures are not audited and are calculated according to International Accounting Standards.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
